    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA are delighted to introduce this 4 bedroom bungalow for sale. A wonderful opportunity to acquire a four-bedroom detached bungalow set in a peaceful countryside setting. Situate only circa 10 mins drive from Carrick on Shannon and Elphin is also nearby. The local National School is just across the road from the property. This house offers well-proportioned accommodation and excellent potential for modernisation, providing purchasers with the opportunity to create a comfortable family home tailored to their own taste and requirements. This property should qualify for the vacant property grant (subject to conditions). The accommodation comprises four bedrooms, living accommodation, kitchen, separte utility room and bathroom facilities, with the single-storey layout offering practical and versatile living. Externally, the property has entrance walls, cobblelock driveway and benefits from a detached garage, providing excellent additional storage, workshop or hobby space. There is plenty of privacy and scope to further enhance the gardens. This house is waiting for its new owner to put their own stamp on it and presents an excellent opportunity for those looking for a country home with character, space and potential. Contact Celia in REA Brady to organise a viewing on 071 9622444. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n7.44m x 1.63m Entrance hallway with timber flooring, window to front, radiator.\n\nSitting Room\n4.06m x 3.77m Sittingroom to the front of the house with gas fire, built in unit, large window to front, radiator and power points\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n4.42m x 4.07m Spacious kitchen to the rear of the bungalow with tiled flooring, built in kitchen with lots of storage space, single drainer sink, large window, solid fuel stove, built in units, power points, tiled over counter, tv point, door to separate utility room.\n\nUtility Room\n3.15m x 1.80m Utility with tiled flooring, radiator, door to rear, window to rear, fitted units.\n\nBathroom\n2.96m x 2.41m Bathroom with walk in shower, wc, whb, window to rear, heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 1\n3.01m x 2.71m Double bedroom at the rear, window to rear garden, radiator, power point.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.92m x 2.73m Double bedroom at the front, timber flooring, window to front, built in wardrobe, radiator and power points.\n\nBedroom 3\n3.93m x 3.63m Double bedroom at the front of the house, timber flooring, radiator, large window, power points and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4\n3.47m x 2.99m Double bedroom at rear of house, radiator, power points, built in wardrobe, timber flooring\n\n\nOutside\nDetached garage Cobblelock driveway Rear Garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 double bedrooms \nSeparate utility room\nGood kitchen\nCobblelock driveway\nDetached garage\n \n Mains water and esb\nSeptic tank \n Nearby School\nCarrick on Shannon and Elphin a short drive away with choice of shops, entertainment, dining, leisure etc\nSports facilities also nearby"
      },
